  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.47,
      366.91,
      455.52,
      404.78
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2 : This clause introduces a new section 18A immediately after section 18 of theCivil Aviation Act, No. 14 of 2010 and the legal effect of the amendment is to maketouting for passengers within the premises of the aerodrome an offence and to prescribefor the procedure in case such an offence is committed.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.599999904632568,
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      226.17,
      167.17,
      401.81,
      178.24
    ],
    "text": "Civil Aviation (Amendment)1",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      194.89,
      230.26,
      205.96
    ],
    "text": "L.D.\u2014O. 7/2017",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      167.85,
      220.69,
      395.85,
      231.76
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE CIVIL AVIATION ACT, NO. 14 OF 2010",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      246.49,
      401.92,
      270.52
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      285.25,
      401.88,
      309.16
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Civil Aviation(Amendment) Act, No. of 2018.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      323.89,
      401.9,
      373.72
    ],
    "text": "2.The following new section is hereby insertedimmediately after section 18, of the Civil Aviation Act, No.14 of 2010 and shall have effect as section 18A of thatenactment:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      388.45,
      401.89,
      541.36
    ],
    "text": "18A. (1) Every person who is found by anemployee providing Aviation Security Servicesof the Service Provider appointed undersubsection (3) of section 6 or a police officer onduty, to be within the premises of the aerodromewithout being duly authorized to do so andtouting for any incoming or outgoing passenger,shall be guilty of an offence and may be arrestedby the police officer or apprehended and handedover by the employee providing AviationSecurity Services of the Service Provider to thepolice officer, as the case may be:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      556.09,
      401.91,
      670.36
    ],
    "text": "Provided however, rendering any servicesuch as arranging transport, accomodation,loading or unloading any baggage or otherarticles into or from any vehicle for anyincoming or outgoing passenger by any memberof the family or friend of such passenger or beingauthorized in that behalf by the Service Provider,a concierge or a representative or agent of thehospitality trade, shall not constitute an offence.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      388.07,
      207.81,
      416.13
    ],
    "text": "\u201cOffence oftouting withinan aerodrome.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      287.03,
      441.93,
      295.89
    ],
    "text": "Short title.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      323.51,
      460.17,
      370.77
    ],
    "text": "Insertion of newsection 18A inthe CivilAviation Act,No. 14 of 2010.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.599999904632568,
      8.0
    ]
  },
