  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      205.75,
      194.29,
      391.79,
      278.56
    ],
    "text": "(2) Every person arrested by or apprehendedand handed over to the police officer inpursuance of subsection (1), shall be broughtby the police officer as soon as practicablebefore the Magistrate having jurisdiction overthe area in which the offence was alleged to havebeen committed.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      205.75,
      291.85,
      391.77,
      388.36
    ],
    "text": "(3) Notwithstanding the provisions ofsubsections (2) and (3) of section 107,prosecution against any person for any offenceunder this section may be commenced and onconviction, he shall be liable to a fine notexceeding twenty five thousand rupees orimprisonment not exceeding six months or bothsuch fine and imprisonment.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      217.75,
      401.65,
      358.76,
      412.72
    ],
    "text": "(4) For the purpose of this section,-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      223.75,
      426.13,
      391.77,
      461.56
    ],
    "text": "\u201chospitality trade\u201d means, any businessactivity or service related or incidentalto the tourism industry; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      223.75,
      474.85,
      391.79,
      571.36
    ],
    "text": "\u201ctouting\u201d means, canvassing with a view toarranging transport or accommodationfor an incoming or outgoing passengeror loading or unloading his baggage orother articles into or from vehicles oroffering any similar service, for avaluable consideration or otherwise,without being duly authorized to do so.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      151.75,
      584.77,
      444.44,
      624.93
    ],
    "text": "3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.Sinhala text toprevail in caseofinconsistency.",
